// """
// NovaX NovaLang Debugger Integration
// =====================================
// Registers NovaLang as the 58th language in the system.
// Provides: REPL, syntax tokenizer, breakpoint support,
// && code editor integration.
// 
// From chat.txt: "NovaLang as 58th language"
